    "description": {
        "en_US": "<p>A 1927 Spanish revival home with its arches, coved ceilings and wrought iron intact, and a kitchen and baths quietly updated for how people live now. The living room centers on the original fireplace, with French doors to a walled courtyard planted with olive trees.</p><p>Three bedrooms, two full baths and a sunny breakfast room. Central Park and downtown San Mateo are a short walk.</p>",
        "es": "<p>Una casa de estilo colonial espa\u00f1ol de 1927 que conserva sus arcos, techos abovedados y herrer\u00eda originales, con la cocina y los ba\u00f1os actualizados con discreci\u00f3n para la vida de hoy. La sala gira en torno a la chimenea original, con puertas francesas hacia un patio amurallado con olivos.</p><p>Tres habitaciones, dos ba\u00f1os completos y un desayunador soleado. El Central Park y el centro de San Mateo quedan a una corta caminata.</p>"
    },
    "features": {
        "en_US": "Original arches, coved ceilings and fireplace\nUpdated kitchen with marble counters\nWalled courtyard with olive trees\nSunny breakfast room\nRefinished hardwood floors\nOne-car garage and storage",
        "es": "Arcos, techos abovedados y chimenea originales\nCocina actualizada con encimeras de m\u00e1rmol\nPatio amurallado con olivos\nDesayunador soleado\nPisos de madera restaurados\nGaraje para un auto y bodega"
    },
